WEBVTT

00:00:00.067 --> 00:00:06.800
Drag the objectives connector to the item objective's in connector

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.700
Connect rewards to the item reward; each output has its own role

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:18.900
Dragging a title changes layout; click Undo to undo the movement

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.400
Save the project; export and upload the runtime quest separately
